{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-1","title":"2 Timothy 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Timothy is exhorted again to constancy and perseverance, and to do the duty of a faithful servant of the Lord in dividing the word aright, and staying profane and vain babblings. 17 Of Hymenaeus and Philetus. 19 The foundation of the Lord is sure. 22 He is taught whereof to beware, and what to follow after, and in what manner the servant of the Lord ought to behave himself.</p>\n<p>my. 1:2; 1Ti 1:2,18 be. 1:7; Jos 1:7; Hag 2:4; 1Co 16:13; 2Co 12:9,10; Eph 6:10; Php 4:13 2Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-2","title":"2 Timothy 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the things. 1:13; 3:10,14 among. or, by. many. 1Ti 4:14; 6:12 the same. 1:14; 1Ti 1:18; 5:22 faithful. Nu 12:7; 1Sa 2:35; Ne 7:2; Ps 101:6; Pr 13:17; Jer 23:28; Mt 24:25 Lu 12:42; 16:10-12; 1Co 4:2; Col 1:7; 1Ti 1:12; Heb 2:17; 3:2,3 Re 2:10-13 who. 24,25; Ezr 7:10,25; Mal 2:7; Mt 13:52; 1Ti 3:2-9; 4:6; Tit 1:5-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-3","title":"2 Timothy 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>endure. 10; 1:8; 3:11; 4:5; 1Co 13:7; 2Co 1:6; Heb 6:15; 10:32; 11:27; 12:2,3 Jas 1:12 a good. 2Co 10:3-5; Eph 6:11-18; 1Ti 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-4","title":"2 Timothy 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>that warreth. De 20:5-7; Lu 9:59-62 entangleth. 4:10; Lu 8:14; 1Co 9:25,26; 1Ti 6:9-12; 2Pe 2:20 that he. 1Co 7:22,23; 2Co 5:9; 1Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-5","title":"2 Timothy 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>strive. Lu 13:24; 1Co 9:24-27; Php 1:15; Col 1:29; Heb 12:4 is he. 4:7,8; Heb 2:7,9; Jas 1:12; 1Pe 5:4; Re 2:10; 3:11; 4:4,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-6","title":"2 Timothy 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>husbandman. Isa 28:24-26; Mt 9:37,38; 20:1; 21:33-41; Lu 10:2; Joh 4:35-38 1Co 3:6-9; 9:7-11 that laboureth must be first partaker of the fruits. or,labouring first, must be partaker of the fruits. 1Co 9:23; Heb 10:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-7","title":"2 Timothy 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Consider. De 4:39; 32:29; Ps 64:9; Pr 24:32; Isa 1:3; 5:12; Lu 9:44; Php 4:8 1Ti 4:15; Heb 3:1; 7:4; 12:3; 13:7 and. Ge 41:38,39; Ex 36:1,2; Nu 27:16,17; 1Ch 22:12; 29:19; 2Ch 1:8-12 Ps 119:73,125,144; 143:8,9; Pr 2:3-6; Isa 28:26; Da 1:17; Lu 21:15 Lu 24:45; Joh 14:26; 16:13; Ac 7:10; 1Co 12:8; Eph 1:17,18; Col 1:9 Jas 1:5; 3:15,17; 1Jo 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-8","title":"2 Timothy 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Remember. Heb 12:2,3 Jesus. Mt 1:1; Ac 2:30; 13:23; Ro 1:3,4; Re 5:5 raised. Lu 24:46; Ac 2:24; 1Co 15:1,4,11-20 according. Ro 2:16; 16:25; 2Th 2:14; 1Ti 1:11; 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-9","title":"2 Timothy 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I suffer. 1:8,12,16; Ac 9:16 as. Eph 6:20; 1Pe 2:12,14; 3:16; 4:15 even. Ac 28:31; Eph 6:19,20; Php 1:12-14; 2Th 3:1 but. Eph 3:1; Php 1:7; Col 4:3,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-10","title":"2 Timothy 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I endure. 3; Eph 3:13; Col 1:24 for. Mt 24:22,24,31; Joh 11:52; 17:9; 1Co 9:22; 2Co 1:6; 4:15; Col 1:24 obtain. Pr 8:35; Joh 17:24; 1Th 5:9; 1Ti 1:13,14; 1Pe 2:10 with. Ro 2:7; 9:23; 2Co 4:17; Col 1:27; 2Th 2:14; 1Pe 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-11","title":"2 Timothy 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>faithful. 1Ti 1:15; 3:1; Tit 3:8 For. Ro 6:5,8; 2Co 4:10; Ga 2:19,20; Col 3:3,4 we shall. Joh 14:19; 2Co 13:4; 1Th 4:17; 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-12","title":"2 Timothy 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>we suffer. Mt 19:28,29; Ac 14:22; Ro 8:17; Php 1:28; 2Th 1:4-8; 1Pe 4:13-16 Re 1:6,9; 5:10; 20:4,6 if we deny. Pr 30:9; Mt 10:33; 26:35,75; Mr 8:38; 10:33; Lu 9:26; 12:9; 1Jo 2:22 1Jo 2:23; Jude 1:4; Re 2:13; 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-13","title":"2 Timothy 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>yet. Isa 25:1; Mt 24:35; Ro 3:3; 9:6; 1Th 5:24; 2Th 3:3 he cannot. Nu 23:19; Tit 1:2; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-14","title":"2 Timothy 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>put. 1:6; 2Pe 1:13 charging. 4:1; Eph 4:17; 1Th 4:1; 2Th 3:6; 1Ti 5:21; 6:13 that. 16,23; Ro 14:1; 1Ti 1:4,6; 6:4,5; Tit 3:9-11 to no. 1Sa 12:21; Jer 2:8,11; 7:8; 16:19; 23:32; Hab 2:18; Mt 16:26; 1Ti 4:8 Heb 13:9 the subverting. Jer 23:36; Ac 13:10; 15:24; Ga 1:7; Tit 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-15","title":"2 Timothy 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Study. Heb 4:11; 2Pe 1:10,15; 3:14; *Gr: approved. Ac 2:22; Ro 14:18; 16:10; 2Co 5:9; 10:18; Ga 1:10; 1Th 2:4 a workman. Mt 13:52; 2Co 3:6; 6:3,4; 1Ti 4:6,12-16 rightly. Mt 13:52; Mr 4:33; Lu 12:42; Joh 21:15-17; Ac 20:27; 1Co 2:6; 3:1,2 2Co 4:2; 1Th 5:14; Heb 5:11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-16","title":"2 Timothy 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>shun. 14; 1Ti 4:7; 6:20; Tit 1:14; 3:9 for. 3:13; Ezr 10:10; Ho 12:1; 1Co 5:6; 15:33; 2Th 2:7,8; Tit 1:11 Heb 12:15; 2Pe 2:2,18; Re 13:3,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-17","title":"2 Timothy 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>their word. Na 3:15; Jas 5:3 canker. or, gangrene. Hymenaeus. 1Ti 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-18","title":"2 Timothy 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>concerning. Mt 22:29; 1Ti 1:19; 6:10,21; Heb 3:10; Jas 5:19 that. 1Co 15:12; Col 3:1 overthrow. 14; Mt 15:13; Lu 8:13; 22:31,32; Ac 5:39; 1Co 11:19; 1Jo 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-19","title":"2 Timothy 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the foundation. Pr 10:25; Isa 14:32; 28:16; Mt 7:25; Lu 6:48; 1Co 3:10,11; Eph 2:20 1Ti 6:19; Heb 11:10; Re 21:14 standeth. Mt 24:24; Mr 13:22; Ro 8:31-35; 9:11; Heb 6:18,19; 1Jo 2:19 sure. or, steady. Ps 112:6; 125:1,2 having. Hag 2:23; Zec 3:9; 4:7-9; Eph 4:30 The Lord. Nu 16:5; Ps 1:6; 37:18,28; Na 1:7; Mt 7:23; Lu 13:27; Joh 10:14 Joh 10:27-30; 13:18; Ro 8:28; 11:2; 1Co 8:3; Ga 4:9; Re 17:8 Let. Nu 6:27; Ps 97:10; Isa 63:19; 65:15; Mt 28:19; Ac 9:14; 11:26; 15:17 Ro 15:9,20; 1Co 1:2; Eph 3:15; Re 2:13; 3:8; 22:4 depart. Job 28:28; Ps 34:14; 37:27; Pr 3:7; Ro 12:9; 2Co 7:1; Eph 4:17-22 Eph 5:1-11; Col 3:5-8; Tit 2:11-14; 1Pe 1:13-19; 2Pe 1:4-10; 3:14 1Jo 3:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-20","title":"2 Timothy 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>in a. 1Co 3:9,16,17; Eph 2:22; 1Ti 3:15; Heb 3:2-6; 1Pe 2:5 vessels. Ex 27:3; Ezr 1:6; 6:5; La 4:2; Da 5:2; 2Co 4:7 and some to honour. Ro 9:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-21","title":"2 Timothy 2:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>purge. Ps 119:9; Isa 1:25; 52:11; Jer 15:19; Mal 3:3; 1Co 5:7; 2Co 7:1 1Pe 1:22; 1Jo 3:3 a vessel. 20; 1Pe 1:7 meet. Ac 9:15 prepared. 3:17; Eph 2:10; Tit 3:1,8,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-22","title":"2 Timothy 2:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Flee. Pr 6:5; 1Co 6:18; 10:14; 1Ti 6:11 youthful. Ps 119:9; Ec 11:9,10; 1Pe 2:11 follow. 1Ti 4:12; 6:11; Heb 12:14; 3Jo 1:11 charity. 1Co 14:1 peace. Ro 14:17,19; 15:5,6; 1Co 1:10; Heb 12:14; 1Pe 3:11 call. 1Ch 29:17,18; Ps 17:1; 66:18,19; Pr 15:8; Ac 9:14; 1Co 1:2; 1Ti 2:8 out. 1Ti 1:5; 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-23","title":"2 Timothy 2:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>14,16; 1Ti 1:4; 4:7; 6:4,5; Tit 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-24","title":"2 Timothy 2:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the servant. De 34:5; Jos 1:1; 2Ch 24:6; Da 6:20; 1Ti 6:11; Tit 1:1; 3:2; Jas 1:1 must. Mt 12:19; Ac 15:2; 2Co 10:4; Php 2:3,14; 1Ti 3:3; Tit 1:7 Jas 1:19,20; Jude 1:3 strive. Joh 6:52; Ac 7:26; 23:9; Jas 4:2; *Gr: but. Isa 40:11; 2Co 10:1; Ga 5:22; 1Th 2:7; Tit 3:2; Jas 3:17; 1Pe 3:8 apt. 1Ti 3:2,3; Tit 1:9 patient. or, forbearing. Eph 4:2; Col 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-25","title":"2 Timothy 2:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>In. Mt 11:29; Ga 6:1; 1Ti 6:11; 1Pe 3:15 instructing. Jer 13:15-17; 26:12-15; Joh 5:34; Ac 22:1-23:11 if. Jer 31:18,19,33; Eze 11:19; 36:26,31; Zec 12:10; Ac 5:21; 11:18 Jas 1:17; 1Jo 5:16 peradventure. Ac 8:22; 1Ti 2:4 repentance. 3:7; Mt 21:32; Mr 1:3,4,15; Ac 2:38; 20:21; Tit 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2ti-2-26","title":"2 Timothy 2:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>recover. Gr. awake. Lu 15:17; 1Co 15:34; Eph 5:14 out. Ps 124:7; Isa 8:15; 28:13; Ac 26:18; 2Co 2:11; Col 1:13; 2Th 2:9-12 1Ti 3:7; 6:9,10; Re 12:9; 20:2,3 who are. Isa 42:6,7; 49:25,26; 53:12; Mt 12:28,29; Lu 11:21; 2Pe 2:18-20 taken captive. Gr. Taken alive. at. Job 1:12; 2:6; Lu 22:31,32; Joh 13:2,27; Ac 5:3; 1Ti 1:20</p>"}]}